{
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "strings": {
    "%lld files · %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld fichiers · %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "14-inch M4 or M5 (not Pro or Max)": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "14 pouces M4 ou M5 (hors Pro et Max)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Action": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Action"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "After about 10 seconds, release the three keys and keep holding power for up to 10 more seconds, until the Mac appears here.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Après environ 10 secondes, relâchez les trois touches en gardant le bouton d’alimentation enfoncé jusqu’à 10 secondes de plus, jusqu’à ce que le Mac apparaisse ici."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "All data on %@ will be permanently deleted.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Toutes les données de %@ seront définitivement supprimées."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "All models": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tous les modèles"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apple Configurator is required": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apple Configurator est nécessaire"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apple silicon, 2025 or later": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apple silicon, 2025 ou plus récent"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apple's reference table": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tableau de référence d’Apple"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Automatic entry needs both Macs on Apple silicon, joined by their DFU ports, and an administrator password.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le passage automatique demande deux Mac Apple silicon reliés par leurs ports DFU, et un mot de passe administrateur."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Back": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Retour"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "By hand, any USB-C port works on this Mac. Automatic entry needs its DFU port too.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "À la main, n’importe quel port USB-C de ce Mac convient. Le passage automatique demande aussi son port DFU."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Cable and connection": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Câble et branchement"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Cancelled.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Annulé."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Change folder": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Changer de dossier"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Checksum mismatch: the file was deleted.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Somme de contrôle incorrecte : le fichier a été supprimé."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Connect the two Macs with a USB-C cable that carries data, then put the other Mac into DFU.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Reliez les deux Mac avec un câble USB-C qui transmet les données, puis mettez l’autre Mac en DFU."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Connected": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Connecté"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Corrupted": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Corrompu"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "DFU Pulse": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "DFU Pulse"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "DFU Pulse relies on Apple's free tool to talk to the Mac being flashed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "DFU Pulse s’appuie sur cet outil gratuit d’Apple pour dialoguer avec le Mac à flasher."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Discard": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Abandonner"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Done. The Mac will restart on its own.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Terminé. Le Mac va redémarrer tout seul."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Download": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Télécharger"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Drop to import": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Déposez pour importer"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Earlier Apple silicon models": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Modèles Apple silicon plus anciens"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Enter DFU automatically": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Passer en DFU automatiquement"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Enter DFU by hand": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Passer en DFU à la main"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Erase and restore": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Effacer et restaurer"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Erase this Mac?": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Effacer ce Mac ?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Flash": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Flasher"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Flash a Mac": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Flasher un Mac"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Flashing failed (code %d).": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Échec du flash (code %d)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Flashing in progress": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Flash en cours"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Get it on the Mac App Store": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "L’obtenir sur le Mac App Store"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hold the power button for up to 10 seconds until the Mac turns off.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Maintenez le bouton d’alimentation jusqu’à 10 secondes, jusqu’à ce que le Mac s’éteigne."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If this Mac asks to allow the accessory, click Allow.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Si ce Mac demande d’autoriser l’accessoire, cliquez sur Autoriser."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Import": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Importer"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In library": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dans la bibliothèque"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Intact": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Intact"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep both Macs on power and this Mac awake.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Gardez les deux Mac sur secteur et ce Mac réveillé."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep both Macs powered and connected.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Gardez les deux Mac alimentés et reliés."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep holding it while you plug the power back in, for up to 10 seconds, until the Mac appears here.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Gardez-le enfoncé en rebranchant l’alimentation, jusqu’à 10 secondes, jusqu’à ce que le Mac apparaisse ici."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Leftmost USB-C port, seen from the back": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Port USB-C le plus à gauche, vu de l’arrière"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Leftmost USB-C port, seen from the left side": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Port USB-C le plus à gauche, vu du côté gauche"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Library": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bibliothèque"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mac being flashed": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mac à flasher"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mac model": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Modèle de Mac"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Middle USB-C port, seen from the back": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Port USB-C du milieu, vu de l’arrière"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Move to Trash": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Placer dans la corbeille"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Move to Trash?": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Placer dans la corbeille ?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No IPSW yet. Download one below or drop files here.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aucun IPSW pour l’instant. Téléchargez-en un ci-dessous ou déposez des fichiers ici."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No longer signed": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Plus signé"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Not enough free disk space: %@ needed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Espace disque insuffisant : %@ nécessaires."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On the front, the USB-C port closest to the power button": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "À l’avant, le port USB-C le plus proche du bouton d’alimentation"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On top, the USB-C port farthest from the power button": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sur le dessus, le port USB-C le plus éloigné du bouton d’alimentation"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Only one USB-C port accepts DFU, and it depends on the Mac.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Un seul port USB-C accepte le DFU, et il dépend du Mac."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open the port guide": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ouvrir le guide des ports"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Other Apple silicon models": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Autres modèles Apple silicon"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pause": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pause"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Plug the cable into the DFU port, with nothing else in the USB ports.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Branchez le câble sur le port DFU, sans rien d’autre sur les ports USB."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Plug the cable into the DFU port. Leave only power connected otherwise, through MagSafe if the Mac has it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Branchez le câble sur le port DFU. Ne laissez que l’alimentation branchée, en MagSafe si le Mac en a un."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Plug the cable into the DFU port. Leave only power connected otherwise.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Branchez le câble sur le port DFU. Ne laissez que l’alimentation branchée."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Port guide": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Guide des ports"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Press and release power, then immediately hold left Control, left Option, right Shift and power together for about 3 seconds, until the Mac appears here.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Appuyez brièvement sur le bouton d’alimentation, puis maintenez aussitôt Contrôle gauche, Option gauche, Maj droite et le bouton d’alimentation pendant environ 3 secondes, jusqu’à ce que le Mac apparaisse ici."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Press and release power, then immediately hold left Control, left Option, right Shift and power together.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Appuyez brièvement sur le bouton d’alimentation, puis maintenez aussitôt Contrôle gauche, Option gauche, Maj droite et le bouton d’alimentation."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Rack enclosure": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Format rack"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Refused: this file is not hosted by Apple.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Refusé : ce fichier n’est pas hébergé par Apple."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Restore": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Restaurer"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Restoring erases everything on this Mac.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La restauration efface tout le contenu de ce Mac."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Resume": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Reprendre"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Retry": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Réessayer"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Revive": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Raviver"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Revive or restore a Mac connected in DFU mode.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ravivez ou restaurez un Mac branché en mode DFU."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Revive this Mac": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Raviver ce Mac"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Rightmost USB-C port, seen from the back": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Port USB-C le plus à droite, vu de l’arrière"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Rightmost USB-C port, seen from the left side": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Port USB-C le plus à droite, vu du côté gauche"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Show in Finder": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Afficher dans le Finder"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stop": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Arrêter"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stop flashing?": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Arrêter le flash ?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "T2 Macs take no macOS image here: Apple's tool picks the firmware, then macOS installs from Recovery.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les Mac T2 ne prennent pas d’image macOS ici : l’outil d’Apple choisit le firmware, puis macOS s’installe depuis la récupération."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "T2 chip": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Puce T2"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The IPSW files stored on this Mac.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les fichiers IPSW stockés sur ce Mac."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Mac may stay unusable until you flash it again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le Mac risque de rester inutilisable jusqu’à un nouveau flash."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The port diagram is schematic: the number of ports varies by model.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le schéma est indicatif : le nombre de ports varie selon le modèle."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tower enclosure": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Format tour"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Unplug the Mac from power, then press and hold its power button.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Débranchez le Mac du secteur, puis maintenez son bouton d’alimentation."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Updates the firmware and recoveryOS and keeps the Mac's data. Try this first.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Met à jour le firmware et recoveryOS en gardant les données du Mac. À essayer en premier."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use a USB-C cable that carries data and charging. Thunderbolt 3 cables are not supported.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Utilisez un câble USB-C données et charge. Les câbles Thunderbolt 3 ne sont pas pris en charge."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Verify": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vérifier"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Verifying…": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vérification…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Waiting for a Mac in DFU mode": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "En attente d’un Mac en mode DFU"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS version": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Version de macOS"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macvdmtool is missing from the app.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macvdmtool est absent de l’app."
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "version": "1.0"
}